	"TagLine": "Adds enhanced Junimo Chests which can access multiple inventories depending on their color.",
	"Description": "![](https://i.imgur.com/Ulr2XSt.png)\nAdds enhanced Junimo Chests which can access multiple inventories depending on their color.\n\n![](https://i.imgur.com/oszWv38.png)\nCrystalline Junimo Chests is safe to add at any time. If you remove this mod, then items stores in non-default colored Junimo Chests may not be accessible to you unless you reinstall the mod.\n\n![](https://i.imgur.com/lG4kcA2.png)\nThe cost to change the Junimo Chest color is configurable by editing the data.json file under the assets folder.\n\n![](https://i.imgur.com/fMhu2q8.png)\nSee [here](https://github.com/LeFauxMatt/CrystallineJunimoChests/tree/main/i18n) for the current status on translations.\n\nFeel free to visit me on my [Discord server](https://lxnq.to/discord)  for announcements and early access to beta releases of my mods.\nYou can also request help from me on the Stardew Valley discord in [#modded-tech-support](https://discord.com/channels/137344473976799233/1272025932932055121)  (ping me @LeFauxMatt).\n\n[Source](https://github.com/LeFauxMatt/CrystallineJunimoChests/)",
